; When both commodities of a purchase are already price targets, the
; commodity of the first posting is the one bought.  A C directive makes
; its smaller unit, sat, a price target, as a P directive does its price
; commodity, $ and € here, so the rule that keeps a known price target as
; the price (#1130) cannot choose, and the wallet takes lots of sat at
; $0.0004 and €0.00037: its cost basis is in dollars and euros, and
; equity --lots carries the lots forward on the wallet.  (With the C
; directive alone, sat would be the price and the dollars and euros the
; lots.)
;
; The balance holds 0.5 BTC reduced to 50000000 sat, and the posting's
; commodity is looked for unreduced, as BTC, which matches neither
; component and leaves the choice to the component that entered the
; balance first, as in xact-price-inference-hours.test.  Left to the order
; in which a balance keeps its components, which changes from run to run,
; some runs would buy the dollars instead, as $-20000.00 {2500 sat} on
; Assets:Dollars, and report the basis in sat.  $ sorts before sat and €
; after it, so no fixed order of the two components can pass for the first
; posting's commodity in both purchases.

C 1.00000000 BTC = 100000000 sat
P 2024/01/01 BTC $40000
P 2024/01/01 BTC €37000

2024/01/02 Buy with dollars
    Assets:Wallet              0.5 BTC
    Assets:Dollars          $-20000.00

2024/01/03 Buy with euros
    Assets:Wallet              0.1 BTC
    Assets:Euros             €-3700.00

test reg --lots
24-Jan-02 Buy with dollars      Assets:Wallet          50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02] 50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02]
                                Assets:Dollars           $-20000.00   $-20000.00
                                             50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02]
24-Jan-03 Buy with euros        Assets:Wallet          10000000 sat {€0.00037} [2024/01/03]   $-20000.00
                                             50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02]
                                            10000000 sat {€0.00037} [2024/01/03]
                                Assets:Euros              €-3700.00   $-20000.00
                                             50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02]
                                            10000000 sat {€0.00037} [2024/01/03]
                                                                       €-3700.00
end test

test bal --basis
                   0  Assets
          $-20000.00    Dollars
           €-3700.00    Euros
           $20000.00
            €3700.00    Wallet
--------------------
                   0
end test

test equity --lots
2024/01/03 Opening Balances
    Assets:Dollars                        $-20000.00
    Assets:Euros                           €-3700.00
    Assets:Wallet                       50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02]
    Assets:Wallet                       10000000 sat {€0.00037} [2024/01/03]
    Equity:Opening Balances                $20000.00
    Equity:Opening Balances             -50000000 sat {$0.0004} [2024/01/02]
    Equity:Opening Balances             -10000000 sat {€0.00037} [2024/01/03]
    Equity:Opening Balances                 €3700.00
end test
